WEBVTT

00:12:59.676 --> 00:13:01.215
and against poaching.

00:13:01.239 --> 00:13:03.277
(Applause)

00:13:03.301 --> 00:13:04.855
Thank you.

00:13:04.879 --> 00:13:08.295
And we can look at our closest
living relatives, monkeys and apes,

00:13:08.319 --> 00:13:11.285
and know yes they grieve,
they feel their lives,

00:13:11.309 --> 00:13:13.806
so they don't deserve to be confined

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:17.139
in highly invasive biomedical experiments

00:13:17.163 --> 00:13:18.774
year after year.

00:13:19.393 --> 00:13:20.546
And, you know --

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.808
(Applause)

00:13:21.832 --> 00:13:25.310
the ducks Harper and Kohl,
they tell us something too.

00:13:25.334 --> 00:13:28.980
They help us connect the dots
and realize that what we eat

00:13:29.004 --> 00:13:31.246
affects how animals live.